#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#26 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#27 (mes)
- "KVM is the abbreviation of Kreiger Von Midgard."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#28 (mes)
- "Adventurer, are you aware that the way to the new world has been opened?"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#29 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#30 (mes)
- "We, the Guillaume Administration, have several plans to advance to the new world."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#31 (mes)
- "And KVM is one of them."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#32 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#33 (mes)
- "It means that we, one of many countries in the Midgard continent,"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#34 (mes)
- "have decided to employ many adventurers for the immediate advance to the new world."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#35 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#36 (mes)
- "Therefore, to select the best adventurers, we are holding the KVM."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#37 (mes)
- "We exspect responses from many adventurers."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#38 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#39 (mes)
- "And we will give them rewards for their participation!"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#40 (mes)
- "As for the rewards, please contact a KVM Logistic Officer."
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#41 (mes)
- "[Guillaume Knight]"
+ ""
#: npc/battleground/kvm/kvm_enter.txt#43 (mes)
- "Basically, KVM is a 3 on 3 battle."
